abstract: >-
  Independent exact GCD verification of OpenAI's supplied 849-coefficient
  product relation. A written algorithm argument, reproducible finite checks,
  rejection controls and scoped AI review are included. The full topology
  theorem is outside scope. OpenAI and Pico / Håkon Åmdal receive predecessor
  credit; substantial OpenAI Codex assistance is disclosed. The compilation
  is Apache-2.0; original MIT and Apache-2.0 component licenses are retained.
